If we want the agents to follow the majority to reuse the towels, then we can simply move the slider to a higher value, let’s say a 3.6 out of 4 scale. If we want the agents to show independence against the crowd, then we can move the slider to a lower value. The right side of the demo shows the agent’s response under different bias levels.

